.playMinion":"Drag the Man-at-Arms (1 mana) from your hand onto the battlefield to summon it.","tuto.step.sleep":"A freshly summoned minion sleeps (Zzz): it can’t attack this turn. Its Taunt (shield) forces enemies to strike it first: it protects you.","tuto.step.intent":"Above the enemy, its intent shows what it will do on its turn: here, it will call for help.","tuto.step.endTurn":"You’re out of mana. Click “End turn”: the enemy acts, then your turn comes back with one more crystal.","tuto.step.endTurn.touch":"You’re out of mana. Tap “End turn”: the enemy acts, then your turn comes back with one more crystal.","tuto.step.taunt":"A Straw Guard appeared. It has Taunt: your minions and hero must attack it before the chief.","tuto.step.attack":"Your Man-at-Arms is awake. Drag it onto the guard to attack.","tuto.step.squire":"You have 2 crystals left: play the Squire of Camelot. Its Battlecry gives you 2 armor.","tuto.step.riposte":"Careful: in solo play, enemies strike back! Every attack trades blows (its Attack hits you back). The red arrow shows who it will hit.","tuto.step.endTurn2":"End your turn: the chief hits your Taunt minion, which strikes back.","tuto.step.heroPower":"3 crystals. Use your Hero Power (2 mana): 3 armor and +2 Attack for your hero this turn.","tuto.step.heroAttack":"Your hero can strike! Drag your portrait onto the bandit chief. Your armor soaks up the counter-attack.","tuto.step.minions":"Attack the chief with both of your minions, one after the other.","tuto.step.lethal":"Lethal! Sword Cut deals 3 damage: enough to finish him. Drag the card onto the chief.","tuto.step.victory":"Victory! You know the basics. More tips will appear the first time you discover each screen.","tuto.duel.foe":"Bandit Chief","tuto.duel.welcome":"Welcome, champion! This training duel against a bandit chief teaches you the basics. You can skip it at any time.","tuto.duel.mulligan":"First, the mulligan: you may replace cards from your opening hand. The Knight of the Round Table costs 5 mana, far too much to start with. Click it to replace it, then “Confirm”.","tuto.duel.mulligan.touch":"First, the mulligan: you may replace cards from your opening hand. The Knight of the Round Table costs 5 mana, far too much to start with. Tap it to replace it, then “Confirm”.","tuto.duel.mana":"These are your mana crystals. You have 1 on your first turn, then one more each turn (up to 10), and they refill at the start of your turn. A card’s blue number is its cost.","tuto.duel.enemyHero":"This is your opponent, the Bandit Chief. The red number is his health: bring it down to 0 to win. Yours is on your portrait, at the bottom.","tuto.duel.playMinion":"Drag the Man-at-Arms (1 mana) from your hand onto the battlefield to summon it.","tuto.duel.playMinion.touch":"Tap the Man-at-Arms (1 mana) to lift it, then tap it again (or drag it up) to summon it.","tuto.duel.sleep":"A freshly summoned minion sleeps (Zzz): it can only attack on your next turn. The Man-at-Arms also has Taunt (shield): enemies must strike it before your hero.","tuto.duel.endTurn":"You’re out of mana. Click “End turn”: your opponent plays, then your turn comes back with one more crystal.","tuto.duel.endTurn.touch":"You’re out of mana. Tap “End turn”: your opponent plays, then your turn comes back with one more crystal.","tuto.duel.taunt":"The chief summoned a Straw Guard with Taunt: while it stands, your minions and hero must attack it, not the chief.","tuto.duel.attack":"Your Man-at-Arms is awake. Drag it onto the Straw Guard to attack: each deals its Attack to the other.","tuto.duel.attack.touch":"Your Man-at-Arms is awake. Tap it, then tap the Straw Guard to attack: each deals its Attack to the other.","tuto.duel.squire":"You have 2 crystals left: play the Squire of Camelot. Its Battlecry gives you 2 armor as it arrives.","tuto.duel.endTurn2":"End your turn.","tuto.duel.spell":"A Bandit appeared. Targeted spells play like an attack: drag Sword Cut (1 mana, 3 damage to a minion) on